ound the globe are meeting K-POP artists through VENTA X's immersive 8K 3D VR content, as if they are right in front of their eyes.\n\nDiscover the latest 8K 3D VR content of K-POP artists, updated weekly!\n\n[VENTA X Original content: 8K 3D VR MUSIC CINEMA]\n\u00b7 A performance that unfolds the artist's songs with movie-like stories.\n\u00b7 VR-optimized performances and immersive CG.\n\n[VENTA X K-POP Series content: 8K 3D VR performance VOD]\n\u00b7 Experience the diverse aspects of K-POP artists, including performances and variety shows, in a three-dimensional VR content.", "short_description": "Enjoy K-POP content produced in immersive 8K 3D VR! You can watch for extended periods without experiencing motion sickness, and the content is shot from an eye-level perspective, allowing you to have an experience of making eye contact with K-POP artists. There's a plethora of content available for you to enjoy!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "00_Logo(Transparent).png", "id": "1444402182919663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003255_1444402186252996_7014711383928885591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7mkLusLlI2kQ7kNvwEtZscy&_nc_oc=AdoDpsIbj8IKZ2IRbAd8Pc49V5SEeAwr5Qe7tifOONBYOxvKvov-y4MasEt_zg7d5bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0kvPnkfmVP5O0zvZQyOVOH-_TOeNQKc_olbcCV5AH6Gw&oe=69F1E39D"}, {"file_name": "03_portrait.png", "id": "1171362250588035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031467_1171362257254701_2035722783743461690_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZmNkab3XR2sQ7kNvwFTaOfD&_nc_oc=AdpOmURw4oZydB0nKgSsSAiDsrwSH4pKfvooZI8p35L4sbLbuhAQIWKRzfPLkGh5FfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1JfqBnBXl1x8cHJRuN7lk5_v-OqOC1iYRnr5oBz1DWaQ&oe=69F1E7A0"}, {"file_name": "01_Hero.png", "id": "1082791666697111", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sconte